{"server":"cn","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_03_beg","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_03","title":"竞走赛","storyCode":"OF-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"cd97304c42dbdb65d73b4bde8d37a734769d6893d25f29aefa26518caf5698d9","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第五关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sunnytown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"黑？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛宁的命令现在就是市长的命令，所有人，动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"把这些人都绑起来。注意不要伤到小姐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"你也以为我是在闹着玩吗？！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"走！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"现在不是说话的时候！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sunnytown_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们沿着这条路往沙滩跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啧，人太多了，不好追。联络沙滩的岗哨，围住他们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"别想走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"！？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"欸？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，走，这里先交给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？！你，你是......！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"锡兰，我们先走！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，哈，哈......博士，我好累......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"终于......到了沙滩......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我也......跑不动了......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"大小姐，请跟我们回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我不要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"别伤着大小姐，那个什么博士随便你们处置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"谁敢随便处置博士！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖B","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"好烫好烫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖C","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"哪儿来的臭小鬼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖C","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"噫！我的屁股！我的屁股！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，博士，你又惹上什么好玩的事情了，怎么不叫上我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖A","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，只是一个臭小鬼，给她点颜色瞧瞧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"我正愁无聊呢，嘿嘿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你的脸色怎么变得比刚才还差？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"伊芙利特，下手别太重！！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"把他们衣服烧光差不多了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"啧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","isRemote":false,"text":"那就三成！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_134_ifrit","aliases":["伊芙利特"]},{"speakerId":"char_188_helage","aliases":["？？？"]},{"speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","aliases":["黑"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["锡兰"]}]}
